              "id": "kb-text-1",
              "name": "text",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "SHIPPING POLICY: We ship all orders within 2-3 business days. Standard delivery takes 5-7 business days within the country. Express delivery is available for an extra fee and takes 1-2 business days. We currently do not offer international shipping.\n\nRETURN & REFUND POLICY: Customers can return any item within 14 days of delivery for a full refund, provided the item is unused and in original packaging. Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after we receive the returned item. Shipping costs are non-refundable unless the item was defective or incorrect.\n\nPAYMENT METHODS: We accept bKash, Nagad, Visa, Mastercard, and Cash on Delivery (COD). COD is only available within Dhaka city. All online payments are processed securely and no card details are stored on our servers.\n\nORDER TRACKING: Once an order is shipped, customers receive a tracking link via email and SMS. Orders can also be tracked by logging into their account and visiting the 'My Orders' section.\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY: Orders can be cancelled free of charge before they are shipped. Once an order has been shipped, it can no longer be cancelled but can be returned after delivery following our return policy.\n\nCUSTOMER SUPPORT HOURS: Our support team is available Saturday to Thursday, 10 AM to 8 PM. We are closed on Fridays and public holidays. For urgent issues outside these hours, customers can email support and expect a response within 24 hours.\n\nWARRANTY: Electronic products come with a 1-year manufacturer warranty covering manufacturing defects. Warranty does not cover physical damage, water damage, or unauthorized repairs.\n\nACCOUNT ISSUES: If a customer forgets their password, they can use the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page to reset it via email. For account deletion requests, customers should contact support directly with their registered email."
            }
          ]
        },
